From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:12:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: add raft release pipeline

Adds the Raft Artifacts immutable release pipeline: the release workflow,
the release contract/publisher scripts and their tests, the producer and
POM-consumer scripts, the empty candidate predecessor lock and the Bundler
lock used for the deployment-mode Pods install. The release set is re-keyed
to 2.28.0-raft.1 (OHOS HAR 2.28.0-raft.1-2.0.21-ohos) and every staging3
branch reference, including the landed/hotfix ancestry checks and their
CLI flag (--staging4-sha), now names staging4.

